1
00:00:32,789 --> 00:00:34,248
她我要了
I'll take her.

2
00:00:42,039 --> 00:00:43,373
过来
Come now

3
00:01:27,498 --> 00:01:29,748
你要将洗好的衣物叠好
You're to make sure the laundry is folded,

4
00:01:29,789 --> 00:01:33,498
碗碟洗净 而且把地板擦到可以在上面进食
the dishes are spotless and the floors are clean enough to eat off of.

5
00:01:39,623 --> 00:01:40,789
食物?
Food?

6
00:01:49,664 --> 00:01:51,498
麻溜吃完干活
Now hurry and get to your chores.

7
00:01:51,539 --> 00:01:53,373
这地板看起来很脏
The floor looks filthy.

8
00:02:58,289 --> 00:02:59,331
好东西啊
Pretty nice huh

9
00:02:59,373 --> 00:03:00,498
瞧瞧这成色
Would you look at that

10
00:03:00,789 --> 00:03:01,914
哇
Wow.

11
00:03:08,331 --> 00:03:10,039
你漏了一点
You missed a spot.

12
00:03:30,623 --> 00:03:33,748
这可不太淑女啊 对吧
Now that wasn't very ladylike, was it?

13
00:03:34,831 --> 00:03:37,789
我建议你记住自己的地位
I suggest you remember your place.

14
00:03:39,414 --> 00:03:40,206
说啊
Say it.

15
00:03:40,248 --> 00:03:40,498
说啊
Say it.

16
00:03:43,956 --> 00:03:47,373
没有您 我一无是处
Without you, I am nothing.

17
00:03:50,164 --> 00:03:51,914
出什么事了
Alright what gives?

18
00:03:52,331 --> 00:03:54,414
有人偷了我的剑
Someone took my damn sword.

19
00:03:54,539 --> 00:03:56,414
给您造成了不便 我深感抱歉
I apologize for the inconvenience.

20
00:03:57,498 --> 00:03:59,123
我们会帮您找它的
We'll help you look for it.

21
00:04:09,373 --> 00:04:12,539
这可不是你的 对吧
Now that's not yours, is it?

22
00:04:14,539 --> 00:04:16,289
我不是来伤害你的
I'm not here to hurt you.

23
00:04:26,373 --> 00:04:29,956
我观察你很久了 我觉得
I've seen you around and I think it's safe to say

24
00:04:30,123 --> 00:04:33,456
你的待遇不怎么公平
you're not getting the most fair treatment.

25
00:04:33,998 --> 00:04:34,748
对吧
Yeah?

26
00:04:34,998 --> 00:04:36,956
我也怪不了你的想法
I can't really blame you for what you're thinking.

27
00:04:36,998 --> 00:04:38,331
你不知道我怎么想一
You don't know what I'm-

28
00:04:38,373 --> 00:04:42,248
但是伤害别人也没法让你的生活变好
But hurting them isn't going to make your life any better.

29
00:04:43,789 --> 00:04:48,289
你可以逃 但这样你就得逃一辈子了
You can run, but you're gonna be running for the rest of your life

30
00:04:49,164 --> 00:04:52,414
或者你可以用另一种方式活着
or you could find another way to handle it.

31
00:04:53,206 --> 00:04:54,164
像你一样?
Like you?

32
00:04:54,956 --> 00:04:58,789
你就可以为所欲为 随心云游
You can do whatever you want,go wherever you want.

33
00:04:59,539 --> 00:05:02,206
你多大了
Ah, how old are you?

34
00:05:03,206 --> 00:05:03,956
十岁
10.

35
00:05:04,414 --> 00:05:07,873
你想变得和我们一样?你想成为猎人?
And you want to be like us? You want to be a Huntress?

36
00:05:10,289 --> 00:05:12,414
那我们还有七年时间
Then we've got about seven years.

37
00:05:12,456 --> 00:05:13,748
来干什么
For what?

38
00:05:15,123 --> 00:05:17,081
来训练你通过猎人考试
To train you for the Huntsman exam.

39
00:06:22,414 --> 00:06:25,706
再过几年 你就不再需要你监护人的许可
Just a few more years and you won't need your guardian's permission.

40
00:06:27,164 --> 00:06:28,289
你就自由了
You'll be free.

41
00:06:35,831 --> 00:06:38,414
妈 快来 我们发现了些事情
Mom, come quick, we found something.

42
00:06:38,498 --> 00:06:39,581
是馨德 她有武器
It's Cinder, she has a weapon.

43
00:06:39,623 --> 00:06:41,123
是馨德 她有武器
she has

44
00:06:48,456 --> 00:06:51,581
有人吗
Hello? Anyone?

45
00:07:05,581 --> 00:07:06,831
您是对的
You're right.

46
00:07:07,998 --> 00:07:11,789
没有您 我一无是处
Without you I am nothing.

47
00:07:13,206 --> 00:07:18,289
但因为有您 我才能成为现在的我
But because of you, I am everything.

48
00:07:25,414 --> 00:07:26,539
馨德
Cinder.

49
00:07:30,581 --> 00:07:32,373
我现在不需要逃了
I won't have to run now.

50
00:07:34,914 --> 00:07:37,039
你今后只能逃了
That's all you'll ever do.

51
00:09:06,831 --> 00:09:08,081
你醒了
You're awake.

52
00:09:08,539 --> 00:09:10,248
我很担心你
I was so worried.

53
00:09:10,873 --> 00:09:12,164
你感觉怎么样?
How are you feeling?

54
00:09:12,206 --> 00:09:16,081
你 你把我带回来了
You, you brought me back here.

55
00:09:17,498 --> 00:09:18,706
我们失败了
We failed.

56
00:09:19,248 --> 00:09:21,956
馨德 你受伤了
Cinder, you were hurt.

57
00:09:22,748 --> 00:09:24,664
我只是想帮你
I was just trying to help.

58
00:09:24,706 --> 00:09:26,539
她已经接受过足够的帮助了
I think she's had enough help.

59
00:09:26,914 --> 00:09:29,748
再说了 她违背了女王大人的意思
Besides, she went against our queen.

60
00:09:30,081 --> 00:09:31,789
如果我是你 我会仔细考虑再站队
I'd be careful who you back.

61
00:09:31,831 --> 00:09:33,539
馨德的预感是对的
Cinder's hunch was right.

62
00:09:33,581 --> 00:09:35,373
如果当时有支援的话 我们就能
If we'd had support then maybe we would've-

63
00:09:35,414 --> 00:09:37,539
你能不能别再替她说话了?
Would you stop trying to protect her already?

64
00:09:37,581 --> 00:09:39,289
她根本不在乎你
She doesn't care about you.

65
00:09:40,331 --> 00:09:43,456
你们俩 都给我滚出去
Both of you, get out.

66
00:09:44,039 --> 00:09:46,998
我下次需要你们时会告诉你们
I'll let you know when you're needed next.

67
00:09:47,039 --> 00:09:49,206
哦对 关于这个
Yeah about that,

68
00:09:49,623 --> 00:09:51,748
塞伦给了我别的任务
Salem's got other plans for me.

69
00:09:51,789 --> 00:09:54,539
我不用再听你的指挥了
I'm not gonna be taking orders from you anymore.

70
00:09:56,873 --> 00:09:58,914
她要所有人都到舰桥上去
She wants everyone on the bridge.

71
00:09:58,956 --> 00:10:00,873
有大事要发生了
Something big is about to happen.

72
00:10:12,498 --> 00:10:14,373
我还是得再说清楚
I'd like to express again

73
00:10:14,789 --> 00:10:18,456
这是我要承受的负担 而不是你的
that this is my burden to bear, not yours.

74
00:10:18,706 --> 00:10:20,331
跟他结下梁子的是我
His grudge is with me.

75
00:10:21,123 --> 00:10:23,206
不 比那严重
No, it'll be even worse.

76
00:10:23,748 --> 00:10:25,123
他并没有使出全力
He's holding back with me.

77
00:10:25,373 --> 00:10:26,289
我能感觉到
I can tell.

78
00:10:26,623 --> 00:10:28,164
是的 我明白
I understand, I do,

79
00:10:29,206 --> 00:10:31,289
但你做的已经足够了
but you've done so much already.

80
00:10:31,706 --> 00:10:34,081
我能为你做的也只有让你休息一阵
The least I can do is give you a break

81
00:10:34,123 --> 00:10:35,623
然后想办法让我们逃离这儿
and try to get us out of here.

82
00:10:36,373 --> 00:10:37,498
我们还不能走
We can't leave yet.

83
00:10:38,581 --> 00:10:39,873
这是我们的机会
This is our chance.

84
00:10:40,081 --> 00:10:43,748
呃嗯 你是不是被打傻了
Hmm, maybe you've taken one too many hits.

85
00:10:44,289 --> 00:10:46,956
塞伦 她知道她不能一次性
Salem, she knows she can't take on

86
00:10:46,998 --> 00:10:48,456
征服全世界
the whole world at once.

87
00:10:48,789 --> 00:10:49,998
所以她没这么做
So she doesn't.

88
00:10:50,206 --> 00:10:52,289
她让她的手下潜入
She has her followers work their way in

89
00:10:52,331 --> 00:10:54,456
由内而外将我们攻破
sabotaging us from the inside out.

90
00:10:55,331 --> 00:10:57,414
或许我们也能这么做
Maybe we should do the same.

91
00:10:57,914 --> 00:11:00,289
你我的确很相似
We certainly are similar, you and I.

92
00:11:00,748 --> 00:11:03,539
或许我们的确有一丝机会
Maybe we have been presented with an opportunity.

93
00:11:07,164 --> 00:11:08,289
麻烦来了
Great.

94
00:11:08,373 --> 00:11:09,914
奥斯卡 拜托了
Oscar, please.

95
00:11:12,539 --> 00:11:14,706
你不需要参加这场战争 孩子
You don't need to fight this war, kid.

96
00:11:15,081 --> 00:11:17,623
告诉我我想知道的事 我就放过你
Tell me what I need and we can be done.

97
00:11:17,998 --> 00:11:20,331
你好 黑泽尔
Hello Hazel.

98
00:11:20,831 --> 00:11:21,914
懦夫
Coward.

99
00:11:22,581 --> 00:11:25,581
所有这些 本该可以是你来
All this time, it could have been you,

100
00:11:25,623 --> 00:11:27,414
你却让他承受苦难
but you let him suffer.

101
00:11:30,039 --> 00:11:33,998
现在 告诉我们这该死的提灯怎么用
Now tell us how this damned lamp works.

102
00:11:34,414 --> 00:11:36,081
这男孩已经受了够多的苦
The boy has suffered enough.

103
00:11:36,123 --> 00:11:37,748
你为什么跟随她
Why do you follow her?

104
00:11:40,914 --> 00:11:41,831
我知道
I know.

105
00:11:43,081 --> 00:11:44,623
我知道你怎么看我
I know how you see me.

106
00:11:45,164 --> 00:11:47,456
但是她 看看她做的一切
But her, look at what she does.

107
00:11:47,498 --> 00:11:48,623
她怎么会是答案?
How is she the answer?

108
00:11:48,664 --> 00:11:49,998
为什么不阻止她?
Why not stop her?

109
00:11:51,248 --> 00:11:53,539
塞伦无法被阻止
Salem can't be stopped.

110
00:11:53,914 --> 00:11:55,539
她是自然之力
She's a force of nature.

111
00:11:56,289 --> 00:11:57,914
我亲眼见过
I've seen it first hand.

112
00:11:58,748 --> 00:12:02,873
但是你 你让孩子去送死
But you, you send children to their deaths

113
00:12:03,331 --> 00:12:07,748
就为了一件你明知不会有结果和胜利的事情
for a cause that you know has no victory, no end.

114
00:12:07,789 --> 00:12:09,456
总有人得试试
Someone has to try.

115
00:12:09,498 --> 00:12:11,039
塞伦不是自然之力
Salem isn't a force of nature

116
00:12:11,081 --> 00:12:12,831
因为可以和塞伦战斗
because Salem can be fought

117
00:12:13,831 --> 00:12:15,623
除非她集齐所有圣物
unless she brings the relics together

118
00:12:16,081 --> 00:12:17,289
如果这件事情发生了
if that happens.

119
00:12:17,748 --> 00:12:18,789
奥兹玛
Ozma

120
00:12:21,956 --> 00:12:24,081
你来得正好
You have wonderful timing

121
00:12:25,623 --> 00:12:27,289
演出就要开始了
The show is about to begin.

122
00:12:52,998 --> 00:12:54,956
有个好消息
We have good news.

123
00:12:57,164 --> 00:13:00,956
提利安从我们亲爱的同事瓦特那里听说
Tyrian has heard from our dear colleague Watts.

124
00:13:02,789 --> 00:13:04,539
虽然他仍被囚禁
Although he remains in captivity,

125
00:13:04,581 --> 00:13:06,831
但是似乎他和埃隆伍德合作了
it seems that he has worked with Ironwood

126
00:13:06,873 --> 00:13:08,414
为了控制这个
to gain some control

127
00:13:08,456 --> 00:13:11,164
装扮成冬之少女的傀儡人偶
over the puppet masquerading as the Winter Maiden.

128
00:13:11,706 --> 00:13:14,039
我想他还是有点用处的
suppose he remains useful after all!

129
00:13:15,206 --> 00:13:18,623
说到这个 馨德
Speaking of which, Cinder,

130
00:13:22,539 --> 00:13:23,789
你没有服从
you choose to disobey

131
00:13:23,831 --> 00:13:25,831
我的明确命令
my specific instructions

132
00:13:27,748 --> 00:13:29,414
又一次失败
just failed again.

133
00:13:30,873 --> 00:13:32,331
然后我意识到
And I've realized,

134
00:13:33,831 --> 00:13:36,789
这都是我的错
it's all my fault.

135
00:13:37,873 --> 00:13:39,914
你这一生都在战斗
You've fought your whole life

136
00:13:39,956 --> 00:13:42,289
为了你想要的事物 坚定不移
unwaveringly for what you want

137
00:13:42,414 --> 00:13:44,664
而我却阻碍了你
and here I am holding you back

138
00:13:45,498 --> 00:13:47,789
没有助你前进
instead of lifting you up.

139
00:13:52,331 --> 00:13:53,831
比起我给你的
You deserve so much more

140
00:13:53,873 --> 00:13:55,123
你值得更多
than l've given you.

141
00:13:57,914 --> 00:14:00,914
去擎天 带回瓦特
Go to Atlas, recover Watts.

142
00:14:00,956 --> 00:14:02,831
他会带你去找那个女孩
He can lead you to the girl.

143
00:14:02,873 --> 00:14:05,914
你 或者 我的猎犬会先找到她
Whether you or my Hound get to her first,

144
00:14:05,956 --> 00:14:07,331
你终会得到
you will finally have

145
00:14:07,373 --> 00:14:09,123
冬之少女的力量
the Winter Maiden's power

146
00:14:09,164 --> 00:14:10,998
而我会得到我的权杖
and I will have my staff.

147
00:14:11,039 --> 00:14:13,373
你只是在帮她带来世界末日
You'll only be helping her bring us to the end

148
00:14:13,414 --> 00:14:14,789
所有人
for all of you.

149
00:14:19,331 --> 00:14:21,289
你太迟了
You're too late.

150
00:14:22,831 --> 00:14:24,581
到底黑进去没有?
Did the hack just not work?

151
00:14:24,623 --> 00:14:26,331
我们怎么知道瓦特可以信任?
How do we even know we can trust Watts?

152
00:14:26,373 --> 00:14:28,748
我们有看见她离开阿米特
We have confirmed visual of her leaving Amity.

153
00:14:28,789 --> 00:14:30,248
她看起来出了点问题
She appeared to be malfunctioning.

154
00:14:30,289 --> 00:14:32,289
所以我不相信科技
This is why I don't trust technology.

155
00:14:32,623 --> 00:14:35,498
我们现在就是在浪费时间找一件垃圾
Now we're wasting our time searching for broken junk.

156
00:14:35,539 --> 00:14:35,581
够了
Enough!

157
00:14:35,623 --> 00:14:36,248
够了

158
00:14:37,248 --> 00:14:39,956
你们是擎天精英 表现像样点
You're Atlas elite, act like it.

159
00:14:39,998 --> 00:14:43,664
呃 长官 我们接到一段公共频道广播
Um ma'am, we're picking up an open comms broadcast.

160
00:14:43,998 --> 00:14:44,748
放出来
Play it.

161
00:14:46,873 --> 00:14:48,289
它径直去了曼特城
It's headed straight for Mantle.

162
00:14:48,331 --> 00:14:50,748
我再说一次 一大群戮兽
I repeat, a large mass of Grimm

163
00:14:50,789 --> 00:14:52,873
正快速接近曼特城
is headed straight for Mantle.

164
00:14:52,956 --> 00:14:54,956
拜托了 有人吗
Please anyone.

165
00:15:02,498 --> 00:15:04,873
好极了 是你们
Great, you guys.

166
00:15:04,914 --> 00:15:06,081
你收到我们的消息了吗
Did you hear our message?

167
00:15:06,123 --> 00:15:07,081
就在那里
It's right there.

168
00:15:07,123 --> 00:15:08,289
我得加快动作
We need to hurry.

169
00:15:08,789 --> 00:15:09,914
Penny去哪了
Where's Penny?

170
00:15:09,956 --> 00:15:11,414
你认真的吗?
Are you serious right now?

171
00:15:11,456 --> 00:15:13,164
人们在危难之际
There are people in danger.

172
00:15:13,206 --> 00:15:17,706
人们在危难之际 是因为你们自私的所作所为和
There are people in danger because you kids are acting selfish and-

173
00:16:18,373 --> 00:16:20,581
是时候了
It's time.